menu "Remote-ready"
	config RR_SELFTEST_FAIL
		bool "Fail the self-test and the trial on purpose"
		default n
		help
			Adds a "selftest_fail" check that always fails, and makes the
			image fail its trial boot, so a board updated to it rolls back
			to the image before it by itself. Only for a build that proves
			the rollback works; never in a product image.
endmenu
